# Startup & Ops

Canonical guide: `STARTUP_GUIDE.md`.

## Split-server production

```powershell
# On 148 (GPU model machine)
powershell -ExecutionPolicy Bypass -File .\148\scripts\setup_148_server.ps1
& ".\148\scripts\start_148_server.bat"

# On 152 (API gateway machine)
powershell -ExecutionPolicy Bypass -File .\152\scripts\setup_152_server.ps1
powershell -ExecutionPolicy Bypass -File .\152\scripts\start_152_server.ps1
```

Always run launchers from repo root `D:\pdf_parser`. The 152 PS1 launcher clears a stale port-`8000` listener before bind.

## Health

- 148: `Invoke-RestMethod http://127.0.0.1:9000/health` (dev: `9001`)
- 152: `Invoke-RestMethod http://127.0.0.1:8000/health` (dev: `8001`)

## One-shot scripts (same-machine)

- Dev: `.\deploy_dev.ps1`
- Prod: `.\deploy_prod.ps1`

## Config invariants

- Prod gateway must set `MODEL_SERVICE_URL=http://10.0.0.148:9000/infer`
- Prefer `.ps1` over `.bat` for reliable restarts
- Clear stale listeners on `8000`/`9000` (or `8001`/`9001`) before restart
